recordLookups.description:
This is used to gather all information from the account from which the button for the TSTree flow was used.

Code for the custom button:
/flow/flow_unique_name?variable.name={!object.field}

/flow/X00002_v1_08_08_19_kabiling?v_acct_id={!Account.Id}

